@shahar1 thank you for the review, I've changed the window dates range to recommended values. 

Re-run updated version, it works well too: 

<img width="2658" height="1308" alt="image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ad35abcc-14ad-4078-8374-ae15e058a763" />

Can we minimize resources needed to demonstrate functionality?  

It will be a positive thing for a community members to run, and for regular tests suite CI runs as well. 

For example: 

```
HO_CLUSTER_CONFIG = {
    "master_flexible_config": {
        "num_instances": 1,
        "core_count": 2,
        "hardware_class": "STANDARD",
        "boot_disk_size_gb": 32,
    },
    "worker_flexible_config": {
        "num_instances": 2,
        "core_count": 2,
        "hardware_class": "STANDARD",
        "boot_disk_size_gb": 32,
    },
    "secondary_worker_flexible_config": {
        "num_instances": 1,
        "core_count": 2,
        "hardware_class": "STANDARD",
        "boot_disk_size_gb": 32,
    },
}
```

And for the update:

```
cluster={
    "config": {
        "worker_flexible_config": {"num_instances": 3},
        "secondary_worker_flexible_config": {"num_instances": 0},
    }
},
update_mask={
    "paths": [
        "config.worker_flexible_config.num_instances",
        "config.secondary_worker_flexible_config.num_instances",
    ]
},
```
